  "findings": [
    "All 27 own PDF/text/SDK ZIP/member byte identities match the current selected lock. Selected June 2026 L011 CN 1.1 remains distinct from superseded September 2025 bytes.",
    "Own manuals and SDK independently establish RXIDLE bit 3 versus TIMOV bit 6, completed-character idle start, separate RDR/RC clear, overwrite/ORE, and native R1W0 no-op 0x1fff. Existing software error priority and best-effort co-latched boundary are documented without attributing exact chronology to hardware.",
    "Current metadata retains 10 selections, 8 family-instance pairs, 2 native versions, 136 canonical UART AF cells and 417 aggregate package-filtered route entries across selections. Aliases have no invented memory geometry; package/debug/oscillator restrictions remain.",
    "The checker examines current semantic facts only. No HAL-source string freeze, historical generated hash gate, mock/model/probe, mutation corpus or recursive checker exists.",
    "Exactly 54 reverse links were appended to 27 current evidence arrays for the new evidence and checker. Removing those exact append suffixes restores original source-index bytes; identity, URL, size, hash, history and old links remain.",
    "Exactly 7 ordinary example files implement combined finite receive and L012 split concurrent I/O on the approved typed routes. The lockfile differs from existing uart-dma only by the root-package name. Metadata-derived memory.x and explicit -Tlink.x are used.",
    "All 6 retained rlibs independently contain ARM ELF objects. All 5 retained ELF artifacts independently have machine 40, expected nondefault IRQ symbols/vectors and load ranges inside selected metadata memory. Retained artifact and OUT_DIR hashes were verified.",
    "All 4 finite main gates exited 0. Current provenance verifies complete hardware sources; optional historical discovery pages are excluded from its hardware scope. Coverage remains a source inventory, not execution proof.",
    "All 905 generated files match the baseline and before/after main snapshots byte-for-byte. Main source 1365 files remained unchanged throughout the 11 serial artifact commands; main ran no generator.",
    "Coverage separates partial native finite_idle_receive from unimplemented buffered_ring_receive. Existing DMA behavior remains bounded by its prior contract."
